  "description": "[I'm not a panty thief!!]\n\nOn the day I was going to confess to my boyfriend of ten years, I ended up stealing the panties that his older brother had taken off.\nHis older brother thought I liked him and ended up reporting me to the police.\nOppa, you're mistaken, I like your younger sibling...!\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Naver Novel](https://novel.naver.com/webnovel/list.nhn?novelId=1058953), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8506580)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=821091), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10642330)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/not-you-your-brother/list?title_no=6239), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/not-you-your-brother/list?title_no=6500), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004310)",
